    q42:acousticMechanism "Tracheobronchial syrinx at tracheal bifurcation with paired labia and sternotrachealis musculature enabling dual-source harmonic/broadband laugh chorus" ;
    rdfs:label "Dual-Voice Tracheobronchial Syrinx (0.6-4.2 kHz Territorial Chorus)"@en .

