    q42:flightGait "Direct heavy flapping woodland flight with shallow undulating glides (8.5-12.5 m/s, wingbeat 4.8-6.2 Hz)" ;
    q42:foragingStrike "Steep oblique stoop from perch 2-12 m high onto ground prey, grasped in dagger bill and bashed laterally against perch branch" ;
